## How to add an insight

When you discover something non-obvious:

1. One-line summary at the top (the rule).
2. Short explanation (2–4 lines).
3. Link to the ticket / Slack thread / commit if applicable.
4. Optional "how to apply" — when future-you should use this.

Keep entries tight. If it can be one sentence, make it one.

